## Running locally (same machine / LAN)

```bash
npm install
node relay.js
```

Server listens on port 3000. In `scripts/NetworkManager.cs`, set:

```csharp
public const string RelayUrl = "ws://localhost:3000";
// or for LAN: "ws://YOUR_LAN_IP:3000"  (run ipconfig to find your IP)
```

